target_id":"7d8b-ffef-de5a-4d12"},{"link_uuid":"e4c43660-7d6c-485b-a2d6-30d8b2d80fa8","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"8e49-3963-b048-4d3e"},{"link_uuid":"eb0bbde1-e968-4faf-9f51-f8e6c09cb9b6","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1794-2ce3-23ce-4024"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe scripts cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `scripts/_backtest/__init__.py:1\u20136` \u2014 Preserve package purpose. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/hooks/serena_grep_reminder.py:2\u201330, 38\u201339` \u2014 Preserve stdin/stdout/nonblocking contract and intentional lexical matching. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh:73\u201376, 124\u2013133, 216\u2013219, 298\u2013304, 329\u2013335, 348, 694\u2013702, 1046\u20131050, 1253\u20131259, 1376\u20131385, 1546\u20131553, 1555\u20131556, 1566\u20131567, 1577\u20131578, 1588\u20131589, 1604\u20131605, 1626\u20131627, 1637\u20131642, 1659\u20131661, 1671\u20131682, 1731\u20131742, 1815\u20131827, 1837\u20131844` \u2014 Preserve opt-in safety, output recovery, bounded convergence, hierarchy/conflict semantics, cleanup. Consumer: manual operators/source readers.\n- `scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh:271, 276, 287, 292, 306, 314, 322, 330, 343, 358\u2013360, 367, 374, 378, 382, 387, 389, 397, 405, 413, 429\u2013430, 442, 459, 462, 467, 544, 562` \u2014 Preserve phase headings and non-obvious scoped-sync, event-store, convergence, and cleanup rationale. Consumer: manual operators/source readers.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/_backtest/__init__.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/hooks/serena_grep_reminder.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3de8-31a0-25ef-456d"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3de8-31a0-25ef-456d","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"3666-6209-1783-47a2","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in scripts \u2014 cohort 01: init__\u2013e2e_val